        # ═══ C370: TRADE-COUNT CAP — fees compete with the target ═══════
        # Round-trip cost is ~8bp of notional. At a 0.35%%/day target on $500
        # ($1.75) with ~$100 notional, each round trip costs $0.08: five trades
